          <pre><code>cd /srv/blueprint
./install.sh</code></pre>
        </article>
        <article class="step">
          <span class="number">2</span>
          <h3>Install on your laptop</h3>
          <p>The installer downloads the native binary and asks for your <code>user@host</code>.</p>
          <pre><code>curl -fsSL https://bp.trasumanar.ai/install.sh | bash</code></pre>
        </article>
        <article class="step">
          <span class="number">3</span>
          <h3>Connect to an agent</h3>
